<title>PHILIPPINES: Petron awards 560 mln peso contract.</title>
<headline>Petron awards 560 mln peso contract.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine refiner Petron Corp said on Wednesday it awarded a 560 million peso contract for the construction of a lubeoil blending plant near Manila to Chiyoda Corp.</p>
<p>Among other items approved at a board of directors meeting on Tuesday was additional funding of 684 million pesos for the construction and installation of new service stations, a bulk plant, an oxidised asphalt plant, an LPG bulk tank, a grease plant and the manufacture of an LPG tank, a statement from Petron said.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
</text>
